      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "The ordinary-evening EP",
      "content": "Yuna is writing a four-song fictional EP about mundane closeness. Two tracks have rough lyrics, one is only a bass line, and the last keeps becoming too sentimental. The two-mug song is about choosing time together, not making domestic service a proof of love. Work can progress in an invited creative scene. No release, upload, recording, or sales claim is implied by the lore.",
